ment_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1820137029:0":{"text":"说不定，生前我生了那么多病，就是在为现在积攒运气呢。","source_cn":"说不定，生前我生了那么多病，就是在为现在积攒运气呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x085609067E162670","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1820137030:0":{"text":"好不容易遇到这么合适的读者，怎么能轻易放过呢？于是——我们就结婚啦！","source_cn":"好不容易遇到这么合适的读者，怎么能轻易放过呢？于是——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7DB5EFC145A8254","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1820137031:0":{"text":"幸福的事接二连三。我们还认识了可爱的小艾维斯——顺便一提，他也很喜欢我写的童话诗哦。","source_cn":"幸福的事接二连三。我们还认识了可爱的小艾维斯——顺便一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6EB45BF17E30457","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1820137032:0":{"text":"嗯！我还给那些角色画了连环画！","source_cn":"嗯！我还给那些角色画了连环画！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5973185267CA248C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1820137033:0":{"text":"哈哈，小艾维斯是诺珐斯最棒的小画家！","source_cn":"哈哈，小艾维斯是诺珐斯最棒的小画家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4D7EBBDBB66FB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1820137034:0":{"text":"对了，还记得童话里，那位很喜欢喝茶的女王陛下吗？你说也想要一套那样的茶具——","source_cn":"对了，还记得童话里，那位很喜欢喝茶的女王陛下吗？你说也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E2F45947DE7008A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1820137035:0":{"text":"——瞧，你的薇薇娅姐姐给你买了什么？","source_cn":"——瞧，你的薇薇娅姐姐给你买了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD6310D03AA098A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1820137036:1":{"text":"哇！好漂亮的茶具……和我想象中的一模一样！","source_cn":"哇！好漂亮的茶具……和我想象中的一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CF9FFC7B9240F3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:43::2":{"text":"精美的茶具","source_cn":"精美的茶具","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142D0FBF94239ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1820137037:0":{"text":"这是……","source_cn":"这是……<key:dialog899>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B01A241696B6292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1820137038:0":{"text":"这是我送给你们的礼物。祝你们……祝你们忌日快乐！","source_cn":"这是我送给你们的礼物。祝你们……祝你们忌日快乐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA7F8393686CA046","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1820137039:1":{"text":"太感谢了，这套茶具真美，我们都很喜欢。","source_cn":"太感谢了，这套茶具真美，我们都很喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25624BEA8E47A013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1820137040:1":{"text":"感谢你来看望莎柏琳。对于亡灵来说，能与生前的亲人相聚就是最美妙而难得的时刻。","source_cn":"感谢你来看望莎柏琳。对于亡灵来说，能与生前的亲人相聚就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB05D0D7DF55B98D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1820137041:0":{"text":"你的到来，本身就是这次忌日派对最大的惊喜。","source_cn":"你的到来，本身就是这次忌日派对最大的惊喜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8588B6565D941BE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1820137042:0":{"text":"为了表示感谢，我特意加了一个小小的节目哦。那就是……向你们展示一首我和莫雷合写的诗歌！","source_cn":"为了表示感谢，我特意加了一个小小的节目哦。那就是……向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40077DA4C4DDA9B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1820137043:0":{"text":"我亲爱的小薇薇娅，就像以前那样，再听我念一次自己的诗吧。","source_cn":"我亲爱的小薇薇娅，就像以前那样，再听我念一次自己的诗吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA2C3BF937958679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","varia